      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDeclare the TP gathered full LM head as a derived buffer and recompute it after source weights are stable. Return the owned stable tensor to logits consumers, and avoid clearing its allocation on load. Register suppression indices as a static non-persistent buffer rather than a weight-derived cache. Adds repeated refresh coverage that checks object identity, addresses, and values.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge #53509 first. This branch starts directly from main and contains only this migration, with no prerequisite PR commits. It is not stacked. Rebase onto main after the core merges before running integration CI.\n\nTracks #57895; ports the relevant portion of aoshen02/vllm#56.\n\n## Validation\n\nLocal Ruff formatting and lint checks completed. Full Linux/backend integration and CUDA Graph replay remain pending; Windows pytest collection is blocked by unavailable uvloop. No remote GPU tests or H20 tests were run.\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nCode and PR text prepared with AI assistance. Human review is pending; this PR is a draft.",
